## 🔄 System Workflow
The following workflow describes how the primary modules interact.

```text
                    TFLCoMentor Platform
                            |
                            v
                 User Registration / Login
                            |
                            v
                Membership & Roles Module
                         (Node.js)
                            |
                            v
                   Select Skills / Concepts
                            |
                            v
                  Skill Taxonomy Module
                          (Java)
                            |
                            v
                Retrieve Questions / Content
                            |
                            v
                 Evaluation Content Module
                          (Java)
                            |
                            v
                    Create / Schedule Test
                            |
                            v
                    Assessment Module
                          (.NET)
                            |
                            v
                    Student Attempts Test
                            |
                            v
                    Submit Assessment
                            |
                            v
                    Evaluation Module
                         (Node.js)
                            |
                            v
                    Automated Evaluation
                            |
                            v
                    Store / Return Results
                            |
                            v
                   Insight Module (.NET)
                       Future Phase
                            |
                            v
                    Growth Module (Python)
                       Future Phase
                            |
                            v
                Personalized Learning & Improvement
```

### Workflow Explanation

**Step 1: User Registration and Login**

Users register or log in to the platform. The Membership & Roles Module authenticates users and determines their access permissions.

**Step 2: Skill Selection**

Students select or explore relevant skills and concepts. The Skill Taxonomy Module provides the structured skill information.

**Step 3: Content Retrieval**

The Evaluation Content Module provides relevant questions, coding problems, and assessment content.

**Step 4: Assessment Creation**

The Assessment Module allows authorized users to create, schedule, and assign assessments.

**Step 5: Assessment Attempt**

Students attempt the assigned assessments and submit their answers or coding solutions.

**Step 6: Automated Evaluation**

The Evaluation Module processes submissions and performs automated grading where applicable.

**Step 7: Result Processing**

Assessment results are stored and made available to the relevant platform components and authorized users.

**Step 8: Analytics and Recommendations**

In future phases, the Insight Module will analyze student performance, while the Growth Module will use performance information to support personalized learning recommendations.

